  "hints": [
    "The pad is at the end of the west corridor. Only LAB-LIGHTS lights it, and LIFT-POWER makes the cable strip in the corridor live. The generator cannot run both (40 and 50 is more than 60).",
    "You cannot end a turn in the dark or on a live conduit, but your echo can. Light the corridor to record a walk to the pad, then swap the power before you launch.",
    "Switch on LAB-LIGHTS and record from the console: walk left, left, up, up and left onto the pad, then wait once and save with {key:echo}. Swap to LIFT-POWER, launch with {key:echo}, then follow the route east and down to the lift."
  ],
