      "concept": true,
      "title": "Only your echo can stand in the dark",
      "explanation": "The pad is at the end of the west corridor, which is dark unless LAB-LIGHTS is on. LIFT-POWER makes the cable strip in that corridor live, and a live conduit is deadly to you. Your echo is immune to darkness and to live conduits. The generator cannot run both circuits at once.",
